    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1964-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(\\log_{10}100=2,\\) the expression inside the square brackets is \\(\\log_{10}(5\\cdot2)=\\log_{10}10=1.\\) Its square is \\(1.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is E.",
      "hints": [
        "Evaluate the inner logarithm first",
        "After multiplying by \\(5,\\) take the base-\\(10\\) logarithm and then square"
